  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6401.06 “Average” means testing a number of samples, the results of which are added together and divided by the total number of samples.\n\nSource. #8454, INTERIM, eff 11-1-05, EXPIRED: 4-30-06 (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 6400)\n\nNew. #8620, eff 5-1-06; ss by #9684, eff 3-23-10; ss by #12526, eff 5-11-18",
